<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear {!Contact.Name},<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We invite your Centre of Excellence to submit <b>project proposals</b> for funding under the <i>WIN (</i></font><span style="line-height:107%"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Wadhwani Innovation Network)</font></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><i></i> initiative.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p data-start="406" data-end="749" class="" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">You will receive a welcome email containing a link to access the <b>grant management portal</b>, along with <b>username</b>. Upon clicking the link, you will be prompted to reset <b>password </b>to log in for the first time.</font></p><p data-start="406" data-end="749" class="" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p data-start="406" data-end="749" class="" style="">Once logged in, proposals must be submitted using the prescribed form available on the platform. Please ensure <b>all fields are completed accurately</b> and <b>all required documents are uploaded</b>.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="">
</p><p data-start="751" data-end="940" class="" style=""><br></p><p data-start="751" data-end="940" class="" style=""><b style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Submission Deadline:</b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;10th May 2025</span></p><p data-start="751" data-end="940" class="" style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p data-start="751" data-end="940" class="" style=""><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">For any queries, please get in touch with the WIN team at <a data-cke-saved-href="mailto:win@wadhwanifoundation.org" href="mailto:win@wadhwanifoundation.org" style="color: rgb(70, 120, 134);">win@wadhwanifoundation.org</a></span></span></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><br></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Best Regards,</span></p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">
Wadhwani Innovation Network</font></span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>